                    {
                        "id":  "starlight-elixirs-guild",
                        "title":  "Starlight Elixirs Guild",
                        "category":  "Factions",
                        "summary":  "Arcane brewers serve mages, scholars, and explorers with aura-sight and weightlessness elixirs.",
                        "body":  [
                                     "Astral Sight Decoction is brewed beneath starlight from moonflower and stardust, then stirred with crystal. Ethereal Drift Potion suspends cloudberry nectar and levitation crystal in midair glass spheres.",
                                     "Star-stoppered glowing vials and iridescent spherical bottles make the guild\u0027s wares unmistakable."
                                 ],
                        "sections":  [
                                         {
                                             "heading":  "Legacy Potions",
                                             "sectionType":  "mechanics-legacy",
                                             "body":  [
                                                          "Aura range, invisible perception, slow-fall, and duration values require conversion."
                                                      ]
                                         }
                                     ],
